      "declaredModernAdditions": [
        "Perfect mathematical circle/straight lines, screen coordinates, and regular spacing are author geometry, not measured source data.",
        "Seven long rows and six short staggered rows on each side are a chosen clean representation; exact total source arrow count and pairing remain unresolved.",
        "Horizontal field directions are normal to the physical sheet in this schematic projection, not a measurement of a projected 2D perspective angle."
      ],
      "retainedUncertainties": [
        "Exact total field-shaft/arrowhead count and one-to-one pairing are not safely resolved in the dense hatched projection from this single view. Seven identifiable long rows on each side are not a claim that each side contains exactly seven arrows.",
        "The glyph is scan-soft; its sigma identity is text-bound, not a claim that every glyph stroke is crisp.",
        "Perspective screen slopes do not measure a physical right angle. Perpendicularity to the plane comes from the source prose and the mathematical model, not a 2D screen-angle reading.",
        "The patch's visible boundary/hatching shows the plane representation, not evidence of a finite thick conducting slab, exact finite plane size, or field inside conducting material."
      ],
